  greetings:
  - You're the cop? Cool. You gonna arrest somebody?
  - Hey. Detective. Got a cigarette?
  aboutSelf: Finish school next year, then I'm gone. Chicago. Anywhere.
  aboutTown: Everybody here's weird-looking and nobody talks about it. It's like a rule.
  seenAnythingStrange: I saw Mrs. Calder at the diner window last week. Like two in the morning. Just standing outside, looking in. Then she wasn't.
  foundersDay: I think it rained? I was out back of the church with Ada's cousin most of it, okay? Aunt Mae won the pie thing. She's not my real aunt.
  gossip:
  - title: About Amos Calder
    response: Mr. Calder's missing his left ear. Says a dog got it. My dad says it was Mrs. Calder.
  - title: About Irene Vance
    response: Mrs. Vance's left arm is too long. From polio. She can reach the top shelf without a stool.
  - title: About Doc Abner Pruitt
    response: Grandpa Abner wears a hearing aid in his right ear. Turns it off when Dad talks.
